    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="find_spec_for_exe-cant-find-gem-bundler--0a-with-executable-bundle-gemgemnotfoundexception">`find_spec_for_exe&rsquo;: can&rsquo;t find gem bundler (&gt;= 0.a) with executable bundle (Gem::GemNotFoundException)</h2>
