    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">gem i bundler -v &#39;Gemfile.lock&#39;</span></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>레일즈 로컬 세팅 mac</title>
    <link>http://localhost:1313/rails-setting-mac/</link>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Feb 2021 16:52:30 &#43;0900</pubDate>
    <author>xxxx</author>
    <guid>http://localhost:1313/rails-setting-mac/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="rbenv-설치">rbenv 설치</h2>
<p>brew로 설치</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="Copy to clipboard"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">brew install rbenv ruby-build</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>환경 변수 추가</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="Copy to clipboard"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">echo</span> <span class="s1">&#39;export PATH=&#34;$HOME/.rbenv/bin:$PATH&#34;&#39;</span> <span class="o">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class="o">~/.</span><span class="n">zshrc</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">echo</span> <span class="s1">&#39;eval &#34;$(rbenv init -)&#34;&#39;</span> <span class="o">&gt;&gt;</span> <span class="o">~/.</span><span class="n">zshrc</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>루비 설치</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="Copy to clipboard"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">rbenv install --list // 설치 가능한 루비 버전 보기 
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">rbenv install 3.0.0</span></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>Rails Ruby 2 4 0 Openssl Bundle Error</title>
    <link>http://localhost:1313/rails-ruby-2-4-0-openssl-bundle-error/</link>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2020 20:05:14 &#43;0900</pubDate>
    <author>xxxx</author>
    <guid>http://localhost:1313/rails-ruby-2-4-0-openssl-bundle-error/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="새로-오픈한-유투브-채널-코딩병원">새로 오픈한 유투브 채널 코딩병원</h2>
<p>채널을 만들자 마자, 처방전 발급
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCk5P3qw9-Oy8l5fnxDF_CNA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">안태의 코딩병원</a></p>
<h2 id="에러상황">에러상황</h2>
<p>rails s 나 bundler을 쳐도 먹히지 않는 먹통
아래와 같은 에러들이 줄줄</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="Copy to clipboard"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-gdscript3" data-lang="gdscript3"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">kernel_require</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">rb</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="mi">55</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="ow">in</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">dlopen</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">..</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="mi">9</span><span class="p">):</span> <span class="n">Library</span> <span class="ow">not</span> <span class="n">loaded</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="o">/</span><span class="n">usr</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">local</span><span class="o">...</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">Reason</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="n">image</span> <span class="ow">not</span> <span class="n">found</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="o">/</span><span class="n">Users</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">p</span><span class="o">..</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">openssl</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">bundle</span></span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 id="해결책-1">해결책 1</h2>
<p>루비를 다시 설치</p>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="Copy to clipboard"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">rbenv uninstall 2.4.0
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">rbenv install 2.4.0
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">gem install bundler</span></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></description>
</item>
